# =============================================================================
# EXPERIMENT DECLARATION — floor1_baseline   (scaffolded by `api.py declare`)
#
# This file is YOURS until `reconstruct.py` seals it: edit the label, trim
# add setting overrides. After assessment the student section is
# digest-sealed — a new idea is a NEW file under a NEW name (§3.1).
#
# PREDICTION (write BEFORE assessing — the seal makes it non-retractable):
#   pipeline: expect RawPointCount to drop on frames with missing depth, and
#             ICPInlierFitness / CoarseRANSACFitness to drop on pairs with
#             large motion or sparse geometry (low VoxelizedPointYield).
#   baseline: expect mapMeanL2 around 0.1-0.2 m; trajectory follows GT but
#             drifts after the degraded segments.
# =============================================================================

